WEBVTT

00:01.365 --> 00:03.765
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:03.765 --> 00:06.965
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.305 --> 00:10.105
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.105 --> 00:14.945
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.245 --> 00:23.385
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:23.385 --> 00:26.855
Dragon Drive

00:26.855 --> 00:32.565
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.565 --> 00:35.435
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.435 --> 00:38.555
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.135 --> 00:43.505
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:43.505 --> 00:45.505
ima mo
I'd still...

00:45.505 --> 00:51.875
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:53.485 --> 00:55.855
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:55.855 --> 00:59.455
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.455 --> 01:04.395
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.395 --> 01:06.095
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.095 --> 01:08.535
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:08.535 --> 01:11.895
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.035 --> 01:17.205
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.205 --> 01:19.945
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:19.945 --> 01:27.545
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:39.725 --> 01:40.715
Here I go!

01:59.145 --> 02:00.135
Shasenko!

02:06.455 --> 02:09.725
I've come here for one reason only.
To fight you.

02:13.725 --> 02:16.455
In tomorrow's match,
be especially cautious of Kouhei Toki.

02:17.295 --> 02:18.785
Kouhei... Toki.

02:20.705 --> 02:23.935
The Catch

02:40.985 --> 02:42.785
The time has finally come, Chibi.

02:48.065 --> 02:50.625
I'm counting on you, Reiji.

02:53.435 --> 02:54.435
I see.

02:54.435 --> 02:55.935
So that lady...

02:55.935 --> 02:56.675
Yeah.

02:56.675 --> 02:58.835
I'm sorry that I couldn't save her in time.

02:59.175 --> 03:01.145
It isn't your fault.

03:01.915 --> 03:02.775
Maiko.

03:03.815 --> 03:05.905
Thank you, Daisuke.

03:07.615 --> 03:09.015
D-Don't mention it.

03:09.015 --> 03:12.615
O-Oh yeah, the lady handed me
a pendant, too...

03:13.085 --> 03:16.025
...but the guy with Kyoji ran off with it.

03:16.755 --> 03:18.225
The guy with Kyoji?

03:19.495 --> 03:20.655
I'm coming in.

03:22.865 --> 03:23.855
Elder.

03:24.335 --> 03:26.665
You all look more like warriors now.

03:27.365 --> 03:28.425
Mr. Reiji.

03:29.275 --> 03:30.605
Miss Maiko.

03:30.605 --> 03:31.635
Mr. Daisuke.

03:32.045 --> 03:34.405
You've all taken on the appearances
of true warriors.

03:34.405 --> 03:36.105
This is so reassuring.

03:36.545 --> 03:38.745
I heard that the final match is tomorrow.

03:39.045 --> 03:43.915
I hurried over because there's something
I need to tell you before then.

03:44.755 --> 03:48.745
There is a legend that has been
secretly passed on within our clan.

03:49.355 --> 03:54.055
It says that if shooting stars
cover the early dawn sky in the north...

03:54.465 --> 03:57.395
...it is a sign that the seal
to the Dragonite has been broken...

03:57.395 --> 04:01.235
...and it shall be interpreted
as an omen of the revival of Shinryu.

04:03.175 --> 04:08.235
So all we have to do
is win the Dragonic Heaven, right?

04:08.775 --> 04:12.715
We won't let RI-ON lay a finger
on the Dragonite!

04:13.315 --> 04:14.305
However...

04:14.955 --> 04:17.355
...if by chance they were
to get their hands on the Dragonite...

04:17.355 --> 04:19.845
...and the seal upon Shinryu were broken...

04:20.825 --> 04:24.915
Then we'd just seal in
that so-called Shinryu once more!

04:25.265 --> 04:26.385
Right, Reiji?!

04:26.665 --> 04:27.995
R-Right.

04:28.295 --> 04:31.065
It won't be that easy.

04:32.435 --> 04:34.835
I checked the details of the legend again.

04:35.075 --> 04:36.075
Huh?

04:36.075 --> 04:38.505
What will happen when Shinryu is revived?

04:39.005 --> 04:40.905
I'll tell you what is written.

04:41.615 --> 04:46.105
When Shinryu, sealed
within the Dragonite, reawakens...

04:47.915 --> 04:50.145
...this world will see its final days...

04:51.015 --> 04:53.045
...and all will return to nothing.

04:55.195 --> 04:57.785
That only applies to Rikyu, right?!

04:58.095 --> 04:59.085
No.

04:59.425 --> 05:05.595
What this means is your world,
Earth, will also be destroyed and vanish.

05:06.335 --> 05:07.465
Y-You're lying!

05:07.665 --> 05:11.695
The Dragonite is something
that has the power to grant any wish!

05:12.805 --> 05:15.295
That's what I've been told!

05:15.845 --> 05:18.505
The Dragonite has no such power!

05:19.315 --> 05:21.505
I-It can't be.

05:22.115 --> 05:24.255
RI-ON only thinks of the Dragonite...

05:24.255 --> 05:28.385
...as a tool to control
all the dragons in Rikyu.

05:29.195 --> 05:33.565
What would happen if those fools
carelessly use the Dragonite's power...

05:33.565 --> 05:36.155
...and break the seal of Shinryu?

05:36.565 --> 05:38.625
You understand, don't you, Reiji?

05:40.665 --> 05:42.065
I'm counting on you.

05:42.405 --> 05:46.175
We mustn't let RI-ON get the Dragonite,
no matter what.

05:47.975 --> 05:49.805
We'll do our best. Right?

05:51.115 --> 05:52.605
Don't worry, Elder!

05:53.015 --> 05:55.185
We'll be sure to become champions...

05:55.185 --> 05:57.375
...and protect the Dragonite!

05:58.055 --> 06:00.315
Daisuke, are you well enough to fight?

06:00.785 --> 06:03.345
At this point, whether I fight or not
isn't important!

06:03.725 --> 06:05.995
What matters is doing our best, together!

06:05.995 --> 06:07.125
You're right!

06:07.265 --> 06:09.035
We'll beat Kouhei and Ichirou!

06:09.035 --> 06:10.825
We'll be the champions!

06:11.235 --> 06:13.095
Just leave it to us!

06:29.755 --> 06:31.305
Are you going?

06:34.055 --> 06:35.545
It's no use trying to stop you, is it?

06:39.725 --> 06:41.395
It has nothing to do with me.

06:41.395 --> 06:43.425
Or rather, it shouldn't.

06:43.865 --> 06:45.265
But I can't leave him on his own.

06:45.335 --> 06:46.635
What a drag.

06:47.305 --> 06:50.165
I'm starting to act like Reiji Ohzora.

06:54.745 --> 06:55.735
Guan-Coo.

06:56.445 --> 06:58.705
How dare you kill my mother?

07:06.155 --> 07:10.185
I finally found him, Yakou.

07:14.265 --> 07:15.725
Yakou was a good friend of mine...

07:16.335 --> 07:18.525
...since we were little kids.

07:20.605 --> 07:22.165
We had fun.

07:22.405 --> 07:24.265
We got into fights.

07:24.405 --> 07:26.065
We played tricks.

07:27.745 --> 07:29.145
We were always together.

07:32.115 --> 07:33.915
We had one dream.

07:35.085 --> 07:37.575
Our dream was to become
the strongest team in all of Rikyu.

07:38.825 --> 07:41.555
We went on a journey,
looking for strong opponents to fight.

07:42.995 --> 07:44.615
That's when it happened.

07:45.925 --> 07:47.795
We came across that kid.

07:58.305 --> 08:00.705
Th-This is horrible!

08:01.575 --> 08:03.805
Even bandits wouldn't go this far.

08:14.795 --> 08:15.775
Yakou!

08:18.695 --> 08:19.815
Don't worry!

08:20.195 --> 08:21.165
It's nothing serious!

08:25.805 --> 08:27.135
Hey, dudes!

08:27.635 --> 08:28.935
Are you all right?

08:29.405 --> 08:30.565
Are you the one?

08:32.905 --> 08:34.035
Did you do all this?

08:34.545 --> 08:36.805
That's right. Got a problem with that?

08:37.045 --> 08:39.035
B-Bastard!

08:39.145 --> 08:40.615
What did you do this for?!

08:40.885 --> 08:42.675
What are you getting all upset about?

08:42.855 --> 08:45.415
These guys were defeated
because they're all weak.

08:45.725 --> 08:48.885
Even if that were true, that's no reason
to go way overboard like this!

08:49.125 --> 08:50.115
Yakou!

08:50.495 --> 08:52.895
I don't think this kid
is gonna listen to any lecture!

08:54.835 --> 08:55.885
Wanna fight?

08:56.565 --> 08:58.195
Shut up!

09:00.265 --> 09:02.865
The truth is, I'm quite disappointed.

09:03.405 --> 09:06.305
I came all the way here because I was told
to go on a journey to train myself...

09:06.305 --> 09:08.345
...but I've only come across these weaklings.

09:08.345 --> 09:11.035
I think we've heard enough
of your nonsense!

09:17.315 --> 09:19.985
You're not much better, dude!

09:25.465 --> 09:26.255
Rockaku!

09:34.505 --> 09:36.135
Rockaku, are you all right?

09:36.905 --> 09:38.995
Y-Yakou.

09:40.145 --> 09:41.405
Escape, Rockaku.

09:41.745 --> 09:42.865
No way!

09:43.075 --> 09:44.675
I can still fight!

09:44.945 --> 09:46.815
At this rate, we're both gonna die.

09:47.045 --> 09:48.245
Shut up!

09:48.615 --> 09:50.105
Don't write me off so easily!

09:50.385 --> 09:52.715
I'm not about to die in a place like this!

09:53.055 --> 09:54.185
Exactly.

09:54.585 --> 09:55.715
You make certain that you survive.

10:01.635 --> 10:03.125
What is it?

10:04.535 --> 10:06.095
Y-Yakou.

10:06.505 --> 10:07.435
You...

10:07.635 --> 10:09.065
H-Hey!

10:10.505 --> 10:11.495
Thundervolt!

10:12.105 --> 10:14.205
From this day on, Rockaku is your master!

10:16.415 --> 10:18.645
Go! Thundervolt!

10:19.185 --> 10:20.805
Y-Yakou!

10:23.285 --> 10:25.025
H-Hey! Come on!

10:25.025 --> 10:26.785
Yakou! Yakou!

10:27.025 --> 10:29.615
Yakou!

10:35.665 --> 10:38.265
You planning to fight me alone?

10:38.265 --> 10:39.695
You'll die.

10:40.165 --> 10:41.465
I won't be defeated.

10:42.605 --> 10:44.205
And I will not die.

10:44.205 --> 10:46.575
Being a sore loser?

10:47.045 --> 10:49.515
As long as Rockaku remains alive...

10:49.515 --> 10:51.605
...I will continue winning,
and continue living.

10:54.985 --> 10:56.975
All yours, Jugem.

11:05.365 --> 11:06.345
Rockaku.

11:07.125 --> 11:11.995
I wanted to become
Rikyu's strongest, with you.

11:20.245 --> 11:24.105
I don't wanna be too hard on you,
so why don't we call it a draw for now?

11:27.345 --> 11:30.405
Yakou!

11:32.225 --> 11:35.125
I will never forgive that kid.

11:35.925 --> 11:40.155
I'll track him down to the ends of the Earth
and avenge Yakou's death!

11:55.115 --> 11:57.405
I hear that Guan-Coo's under attack!

11:58.745 --> 12:01.235
Really? B-By who?

12:03.185 --> 12:04.685
I forgot to ask.

12:04.685 --> 12:05.655
You're hopeless.

12:05.855 --> 12:08.115
It's probably that guy.

12:08.495 --> 12:10.255
You're right, Reiji.

12:11.395 --> 12:12.825
K-Kyoji?!

12:15.735 --> 12:17.285
H-Hey.

12:25.105 --> 12:26.865
D-Damn you.

12:32.245 --> 12:33.775
So that's what happened.

12:34.285 --> 12:36.345
That's why he went to Guan-Coo.

12:37.185 --> 12:38.675
And to think...

12:38.955 --> 12:40.975
...that person was his mother.

12:41.425 --> 12:44.895
We charged into Guan-Coo's residence
to take revenge...

12:44.895 --> 12:46.985
...but without much luck.

12:47.565 --> 12:49.555
I just hope he doesn't overdo it.

12:50.135 --> 12:50.895
Yeah.

12:50.895 --> 12:53.395
But as it is, he has little chance
against Guan-Coo.

12:53.605 --> 12:54.695
He'd only get killed.

13:02.915 --> 13:03.905
Rockaku!

13:05.945 --> 13:08.545
This has nothing to do with me.

13:08.915 --> 13:10.175
Go ahead, Reiji.

13:11.185 --> 13:13.175
Wh-What are you saying?!

13:13.485 --> 13:15.515
The final round is about to begin!

13:16.125 --> 13:17.885
The final round?

13:18.255 --> 13:19.655
What about it?

13:20.195 --> 13:22.185
Who cares about that?

13:22.835 --> 13:23.955
Right, Reiji?

13:24.165 --> 13:25.795
That's of little importance to either of us.

13:26.135 --> 13:27.765
What's wrong, Rockaku?

13:28.135 --> 13:29.475
To tell the truth...

13:29.475 --> 13:32.995
...the Dragonic Heaven and the Dragonite
were never all that important to me.

13:33.605 --> 13:35.805
As long as I have a chance to crush that kid!

13:36.545 --> 13:38.215
Kouhei Toki's the one you want, right?

13:38.215 --> 13:39.735
To avenge your friend's death?

13:39.985 --> 13:40.985
Yeah.

13:40.985 --> 13:42.415
I finally found him!

13:42.815 --> 13:45.345
From this point on,
I'm gonna do whatever I want!

13:45.585 --> 13:46.575
Rockaku!

13:47.825 --> 13:48.955
And besides...

13:48.955 --> 13:53.295
...it's distracting to be around people who
can't concentrate on an upcoming match!

13:54.765 --> 13:56.125
Get outta here!

13:56.595 --> 13:57.625
Mm-hm.

13:57.835 --> 13:59.165
R-Reiji.

13:59.705 --> 14:01.335
He's right.

14:01.335 --> 14:04.325
I'm having trouble concentrating on
the fight because of my concern for Mukai.

14:05.105 --> 14:06.735
So, I'm going!

14:07.345 --> 14:08.275
Reiji.

14:08.775 --> 14:09.915
Okay!

14:09.915 --> 14:13.105
Why don't we go for a light warm-up
before our match?!

14:17.355 --> 14:18.955
We'll be right back!

14:18.955 --> 14:20.385
So please hold on until then!

14:28.295 --> 14:30.385
Be careful, Reiji.

14:34.965 --> 14:37.635
Not yet! I will not be defeated!

14:38.075 --> 14:39.775
Until I avenge my mother's death...

14:39.775 --> 14:42.245
...and the destruction of my village...

14:42.245 --> 14:44.605
...I cannot and will not die!

15:04.335 --> 15:06.325
Where are Reiji and the others?

15:15.245 --> 15:17.935
Let's go, Thundervolt!

15:24.155 --> 15:26.515
He's not here. Where are you, Reiji?

15:29.925 --> 15:32.955
That's her. So we finally meet.

15:33.995 --> 15:35.865
Let's get this over with.

15:35.865 --> 15:37.725
I don't have time.

15:38.035 --> 15:39.695
As you wish!

15:40.105 --> 15:42.065
Say your prayers, kid!

15:47.305 --> 15:50.205
Here I go!

15:51.675 --> 15:54.705
Dude, I thought maybe you were planning
to run away alone again.

15:54.845 --> 15:58.085
I'll have no problem finishing you off alone!

15:59.925 --> 16:01.475
Sounds like fun.

16:18.845 --> 16:20.745
Wh-What's happening?!

16:24.515 --> 16:26.615
Hey! What do you think you're doing?!

16:26.615 --> 16:27.915
There must be three members per team.

16:27.915 --> 16:31.755
With two people missing from your team,
we cannot allow you to participate.

16:31.755 --> 16:32.745
What the hell?!

16:33.455 --> 16:35.515
What a shame, dude.

16:35.755 --> 16:37.555
But we gotta follow the rules.

16:37.555 --> 16:38.545
Right?!

16:51.035 --> 16:52.505
Blast!

17:09.555 --> 17:11.455
Let me fight, too!

17:11.655 --> 17:14.425
Let me avenge Yakou's death!

17:16.395 --> 17:17.795
Shadow Fang!

17:30.575 --> 17:32.135
I brought backup!

17:32.485 --> 17:33.465
What?!

17:35.415 --> 17:36.975
Are you all right, Mukai?!

17:37.655 --> 17:38.645
Reiji.

17:39.755 --> 17:41.415
What are you doing here?!

17:41.785 --> 17:43.755
I need no help!

17:43.855 --> 17:45.055
Don't be so stubborn.

17:45.195 --> 17:46.885
They're friends we fought against.

17:47.295 --> 17:48.065
Friends?

17:48.065 --> 17:49.965
That's right, Mukai!

17:50.195 --> 17:53.725
A friend of Kyoji is a friend of mine!

17:55.635 --> 17:57.395
I'll help you right away!

17:57.775 --> 18:00.745
If I remember correctly,
your name's Reiji Ohzora. Right?

18:00.745 --> 18:01.675
Huh?

18:01.675 --> 18:03.975
You are to add a "Lord"
whenever addressing me!

18:03.975 --> 18:05.075
It's Lord Mukai!

18:06.085 --> 18:07.985
Wh-Whatever you say, Mukai.

18:07.985 --> 18:09.915
Lord Mukai!

18:10.315 --> 18:11.475
Let's go, everyone!

18:11.855 --> 18:12.685
Yeah!

18:14.355 --> 18:15.485
We have a winner!

18:17.595 --> 18:21.155
The winning team
of this Dragonic Heaven Tournament...

18:21.625 --> 18:24.865
...is this team, representing Yaudim!

18:28.635 --> 18:30.975
For this team's achievements...

18:30.975 --> 18:33.965
...we shall now commence
the ceremony of honor!

18:34.175 --> 18:35.145
This isn't good.

18:35.145 --> 18:36.575
At this rate...

18:36.845 --> 18:37.835
Reiji.

18:44.785 --> 18:47.485
D-Damn.

19:02.905 --> 19:03.995
Kyoji.

19:05.405 --> 19:08.275
Why are they fighting on my behalf?

19:09.015 --> 19:10.565
Reiji told you.

19:11.575 --> 19:13.135
Because they are your friends.

19:13.385 --> 19:15.675
My... friends.

19:18.855 --> 19:19.915
Now, Mukai!

19:20.085 --> 19:21.185
Guan-Coo!

19:21.355 --> 19:23.255
Take this!

19:35.675 --> 19:37.865
Appear before us!

19:39.475 --> 19:44.605
Sorry, but from here,
only I, the leader, may proceed.

19:58.865 --> 20:00.295
Mother.

20:02.535 --> 20:05.125
- Daisuke!
- Wh-What is it?

20:05.835 --> 20:10.735
I thank you for being by my mother's side
as she passed away.

20:11.205 --> 20:13.605
R-Right.

20:14.445 --> 20:15.845
Reiji Ohzora.

20:16.315 --> 20:17.615
Thanks for everything.

20:17.615 --> 20:20.105
Don't mention it.

20:22.355 --> 20:23.645
He's one difficult fellow.

20:50.475 --> 20:51.575
Wait!

20:52.015 --> 20:54.005
You mustn't proceed any further!

20:54.185 --> 20:55.755
Huh? Why not?

20:55.755 --> 20:56.915
I'm the champion.

21:00.085 --> 21:01.785
Wh-Why, this is...

21:01.985 --> 21:02.975
What's wrong?

21:03.195 --> 21:04.755
Th-The Dragonite.

21:04.755 --> 21:06.155
It's sensing something evil.

21:06.395 --> 21:08.525
But that's impossible.

21:08.965 --> 21:11.935
There's no one around
with as pure a heart as mine.

21:11.935 --> 21:13.265
You mustn't go.

21:13.505 --> 21:15.405
You mustn't touch the Dragonite!

21:16.275 --> 21:18.265
How dare you give me orders?!

21:24.175 --> 21:26.705
I now have my last item.

21:27.115 --> 21:28.745
H-How can this be?

21:29.185 --> 21:31.985
We're now entering the final stage.

21:55.915 --> 21:58.715
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:58.715 --> 22:01.485
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:01.485 --> 22:06.885
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:06.885 --> 22:09.625
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:09.625 --> 22:12.295
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.295 --> 22:16.325
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:17.795 --> 22:20.535
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:20.535 --> 22:22.265
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.205 --> 22:27.265
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:28.545 --> 22:31.105
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.445 --> 22:34.085
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.085 --> 22:39.105
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:39.525 --> 22:42.355
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.355 --> 22:45.025
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.025 --> 22:50.025
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:50.465 --> 22:53.205
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.205 --> 22:55.905
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:55.905 --> 23:00.805
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

